 "body": "Hi! \u00b0\u25bd\u00b0)\u256f\nI absolutely love your art style and coloring! The colors are stunning, and your works always catch my eye! I\u2019d love to commission you for an illustration as a birthday gift for myself\ud83c\udf82.\nDetails:\nOC have Orange eyes, long wavy blue hair (waist-length), pale cool-toned skin\u3002\n\u2757 If possible,i hope you could add suitable lipstick and blue nail polish for her.\nTheme: Balloon Party \ud83c\udf88\nThe OC's setting is that she is a puppet from an abandoned circus. Every day, she lures lost people into the circus, and after the performance, she turns them into puppets\u2014so she will never be alone.\nIf possible, I\u2019d love for there to be some balloons in the illustration, and you can freely choose the character\u2019s pose and action.\nYou can select an outfit from the link below for the artwork. If any part is difficult to draw, feel free to simplify or omit it.( \u2022\u0300 .\u032b \u2022\u0301 )\u2727\nIf the amount is not enough, please do not hesitate to modify it!\nThank you so much!   (\u3003\uffe3\ufe36\uffe3)\u4eba(\uffe3\ufe36\uffe3\u3003) \ud83d\udc96\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1E9QkW79ydro0VrmkU-BOdgdOr6e3ch8d?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Psydeworks/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d25c3127/uploads/origins/20e45786-0c8d-4b86-b933-ced64ad21f64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ea98a713fe99dd0dd6c99d2a3429ded0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d25c3127/uploads/origins/20e45786-0c8d-4b86-b933-ced64ad21f64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ea98a713fe99dd0dd6c99d2a3429ded0, https://si.imgix.net/