rigins/5db7c606-1429-459e-84f2-657d1bd907b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=68e4999e6ef190103e9a4d97ab144da9, https://si.imgix.net/d876b870/uploads/origins/5db7c606-1429-459e-84f2-657d1bd907b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e2461a9f8cd4542271b7f528175c7b1a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d876b870/uploads/origins/5db7c606-1429-459e-84f2-657d1bd907b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=54a060b06d72a0b519da25cbfae7d229 3x"}, "body": "Hi Sensei,\n\nThank you for the appeal, your art is very cool, and the colouring is amazing. I would be happy to request one for my oc! \n\nI put one of my ocs\u2019 description in the request box, but please feel free to choose any other characters in my profile page!\n\nShe is a non-human girl with horns and long curly hair. Her existence is based on human\u2019s pain, or it can be said that she is the concept of \u201cpain\u201d itself. Her themes include \u201cflower of blood and flesh\u201d, \u201cpainful\u201d, \u201cbeing a prisoner of her own mind\u201d. Please feel free to draw anything you think suits her best! You can also adjust or simplify her clothing if it works better. \n\nYou can find her detailed appearance in the attached link.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1WvCC84lpiVWahpDmlE5elardOUwiE2Zt", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Psydeworks/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 665615, "client_id": 755125, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3b6ea481/uploads/origins/de61aaca-bfa1-427d-a208-76ca609d6d88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ab444b809ceae196daa78639410c2b2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3b6ea481/uploads/origins/de61aaca-bfa1-427d-a208-76c